                <pb facs="1259" n="1245" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg1245"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Korea/7–1648: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Philippines</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lockett</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Manila</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-07-16T11:00:00+08:00">July 16, 1948—11
                            a. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1305, Contents of Depcirtel July 10, 1 p. m. [<hi rendition="#italic">a.
                    m.</hi>], concerning action to be taken in Korea relative problem recognition
                    Korean Government to be formed as result May 10 elections were discussed
                    yesterday with President Quirino. He stated “My government is a member of UNTCOK
                    and therefore I feel that measures decided upon by the Commission should be
                    supported. I see no objection to the plan of action contemplated by the US soon
                    after the formation of the new Korean Government”.</p>
                <p>The latter part of the foregoing statement refers to paragraph numbered 6
                    Depcirtel July 10, 1 p. m. [<hi rendition="#italic">a. m.</hi>] which I had just
                    read to him verbatim.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lockett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
